{
  "id": "discount_rates",
  "title": "Discount Rates",
  "description": "Calculate net price after applying single or multiple discount rates to a list price. Enter the list price and up to 4 discount rates to compute the final net price.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Discount Rates Calculator\n\nA discount is a deduction in percentage from the original price offered by the supplier.\n\n- The **base** is the original price of the item - the *list price*\n- The price after discount is the *net price*\n\n### Formula\n\n**Single Discount:** N = L (1 - i / 100)\n\n**Multiple Discounts:** N = L (1 - i₁ / 100) (1 - i₂ / 100) ... (1 - iₙ / 100)\n\nWhere:\n- N = net price\n- L = list price\n- i = discount rate (%)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "list_price",
          "label": "List Price",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 500,
          "unit": "$"
        },
        {
          "id": "discount_1",
          "label": "Discount Rate 1",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "discount_2",
          "label": "Discount Rate 2",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "discount_3",
          "label": "Discount Rate 3",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "discount_4",
          "label": "Discount Rate 4",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0,
          "unit": "%"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "net_price_factor",
          "label": "Net Price Factor",
          "formula": "(1 - inputs.discount_1 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_2 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_3 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_4 / 100)"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_discount_percent",
          "label": "Total Discount",
          "formula": "(1 - (1 - inputs.discount_1 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_2 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_3 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_4 / 100)) * 100",
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "net_price",
          "label": "Net Price",
          "formula": "inputs.list_price * (1 - inputs.discount_1 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_2 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_3 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_4 / 100)",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_discount_amount",
          "label": "Total Discount Amount",
          "formula": "inputs.list_price - inputs.list_price * (1 - inputs.discount_1 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_2 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_3 / 100) * (1 - inputs.discount_4 / 100)",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Discount Rates (%)",
        "Net Price Factor"
      ],
